# 💻 Practiced Logic Code

## 1. Basic Decorator — Before Function

```python
def decorator(function):

    def wraping():
        print("Starting function")
        function()

    return wraping


@decorator
def hello():
    print("Hello Manoj")


hello()
```

## 2. Basic Decorator — After Function

```python
def decorator(function):

    def wraping():
        function()
        print("Function completed")

    return wraping


@decorator
def hello():
    print("Hello Manoj")


hello()
```

## 3. Before and After Logic

```python
def decorator(function):

    def wraping():
        print("--------START-------")
        function()
        print("--------END--------")

    return wraping


@decorator
def hello():
